:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[Cat Kart P (Enemy)]].''
'''Cat Kart R''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.7 Update|Version 3.7]] and can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[The Battle Cats POP! (Special Event)|The Battle Cats POP!]]. [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]] adds its [[True Form]] which triples attack power but increases time between attacks, and adds [[Multi-Hit]].

